dcroxide-secp256k1-vartime contains code translated from libsecp256k1
(https://github.com/bitcoin-core/secp256k1), as vendored by secp256k1-sys
0.14.1. That code is under the MIT licence below; the files derived from it
say so in their headers (SPDX-License-Identifier: ISC AND MIT).

